	<ouc:div label="main-content" group="Everyone" button-text="Main Content"><ouc:editor csspath="/_resources/ou/editor/wysiwyg.css" cssmenu="/_resources/ou/editor/styles.txt" wysiwyg-class="main-content"/><div style="text-align: center;"><img class="" src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/ltcc_images/academics/metamajor_icons/society-culture-education-white-back.jpg" alt="Society, Culture, &amp; Education" width="308" height="328" /></div>
<p style="text-align: left;">Explore human relationships, communities, and global connections while sharing your knowledge with others. Spark discussions about the&nbsp;inner&nbsp;workings of society and culture, and help create positive change. Open doors to jobs in counseling, education, social work, community development, cultural research, and human resources.</p>
